+# Final productionization checklist (level-4)
+
+1) KMS & Rekor
+ - Provision KMS keys (AWS/GCP/Azure) for cosign.
+ - Deploy Rekor server or use managed Rekor; ensure REKOR_SERVER is reachable from CI runners and cluster.
+ - Configure CI and approver to use COSIGN_KEY and REKOR_SERVER.
+
+2) Databases
+ - Deploy approver-postgres and qpu-postgres (StatefulSets provided).
+ - Run DB migrations (db/migrations).
+
+3) HA infra
+ - Deploy Redis cluster via Helm/Operator using k8s/infra/redis-cluster-values.yaml.
+ - Deploy Strimzi operator & Kafka cluster (k8s/infra/strimzi-kafka-cluster.yaml).
+ - Deploy MLflow with persistent Postgres and S3-compatible artifact store (k8s/infra/mlflow-deployment.yaml).
+ - Deploy Trino + Hive metastore (k8s/infra/trino-deployment.yaml).
+
+4) TRT CI runner
+ - Provision self-hosted GPU runners with matching CUDA/TensorRT versions.
+ - Use .github/workflows/trt_bake_and_sign.yml and trt_bake.sh to bake and sign .plan artifacts.
+
+5) Hardened jailed executor
+ - Deploy hardened manifests and run pentest checklist (docs/pentest).
+ - Ensure automatic revocation & rotate cosign keys on incidents.
+
+6) Extended canaries and rollback
+ - Deploy extended canary Argo workflows and auto_rollback scripts.
+ - Run 7+ day canaries and red-team tests; verify rollback behavior.
